    "summary_one_sentence": "When Connect 3 loses their tour's opening act, they return to Camp Rock to find a new performer, sparking fierce competition, tested friendships, and surprising new romances among the campers.",
    "summary_short": "Facing a sudden vacancy for the opening act of their major reunion tour, the members of Connect 3 decide to head back to where it all began: Camp Rock. The announcement sets off a high-stakes competition among ambitious young talent eager for their big break. As the campers push their creative limits, rivalries flare up and personal relationships are put to the test. Ultimately, the quest for stardom reveals unexpected alliances and brings fresh passion back to the legendary camp.",
    "summary_long": "Connect 3 is set to embark on a massive reunion tour, but panic strikes when their scheduled opening act abruptly drops out. Desperate for a fresh and authentic talent to fill the slot, the band decides to return to Camp Rock to host an exclusive showcase competition. News of the opportunity spreads quickly, sparking intense excitement and fierce ambition throughout the camp. Best friends find themselves pitted against each other as everyone scrambles to refine their musical acts and secure the coveted spot. Amidst the relentless rehearsals and rising pressure, hidden talents come to light and unlikely partnerships begin to form. Romantic sparks also fly as old feelings resurface and new connections spark under the summer sun. However, ego clashes and miscommunications threaten to derail several performances before the final showcase even begins. Through moments of self-doubt and unexpected revelations, the campers learn that true artistry comes from heart, collaboration, and staying genuine. In the end, the spectacular final night delivers unforgettable performances that redefine the future for both Connect 3 and Camp Rock's rising stars.",
    "synopsis": "Camp Rock 3 brings viewers back to the iconic summer destination for a high-energy story centered on music, ambition, and community. When the world-renowned band Connect 3 finds themselves without an opening act right before a highly anticipated reunion tour, they return to Camp Rock to scout for fresh, undiscovered talent. The band announces a camp-wide showcase where the winner will join them on stage nationwide, igniting a passionate rivalry among the aspiring young musicians. As campers navigate the pressures of competition, long-standing friendships are tested, hidden secrets come to light, and romantic sparks ignite in unexpected places. Rich with catchy original songs and heartfelt character dynamics, this vibrant installment explores the power of staying true to one's voice, the importance of teamwork, and the transformative spirit of music.",
